<instruction name="VPSHUFBITQMB">
 <copyright>Copyright (C) Intel Corporation. All Rights Reserved.</copyright>
 <shortdesc>Shuffle Bits From Quadword Elements Using Byte Indexes Into Mask</shortdesc>
