     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046426">EVEX.128.66.0F38.W0 8F /r</para>
      <para unique="1046427">VPSHUFBITQMB k1{k2}, xmm2, xmm3/m128</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046431">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046433">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046435">(AVX512_BITALG</para>
      <para unique="1046436">AND AVX512VL) OR AVX10.1 <anchor id="+697743"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046441">Extract values in xmm2 using control bits of xmm3/m128 with writemask k2 and load the result into mask register k1.</para>
