      <para unique="1046422">AND AVX512VL) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+316403"/> </para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046424">Extract values in ymm2 using control bits of ymm3/m256 with writemask k2 and load the result into mask register k1.</para>
